{"3869250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Auto Grind: Dungeons", "steam_appid": 3869250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto Grind: Dungeons encapsulates the classic dungeon grind group experience into a single-player auto-combat RPG. Grind-friendly features such as auto use of skills, auto loot pick up and optional auto move, for people who love to theory craft, progress characters and grind without the burnout of long hours of very active gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/1769fe53e1ba7643ed81fc403d17b3d1.poster.avif?t=1761069744\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/1769fe53e1ba7643ed81fc403d17b3d1.webm?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/1769fe53e1ba7643ed81fc403d17b3d1.mp4?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a party of up to five characters, choosing any combination of the Warrior, Archer, and Mage classes and customize their builds to fit any role you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/8d1d3ec8110783bfc54dcc779136db0f.poster.avif?t=1761069744\" width=442 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/8d1d3ec8110783bfc54dcc779136db0f.webm?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/8d1d3ec8110783bfc54dcc779136db0f.mp4?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills include attacks, spells, buffs, auras and passives. Everything triggers automatically based on cooldowns and conditions, keeping the player's focus on build synergy and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/b9cc14c6c9efdba64bf961eaa648b6aa.poster.avif?t=1761069744\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/b9cc14c6c9efdba64bf961eaa648b6aa.webm?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/b9cc14c6c9efdba64bf961eaa648b6aa.mp4?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the combinator crafting system to merge and refine items toward your characters build BIS goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/6e89b5b798cbfbabcdd50e4900601f38.poster.avif?t=1761069744\" width=616 height=383 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/6e89b5b798cbfbabcdd50e4900601f38.webm?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord community to participate in the Beta or discuss about the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto Grind: Dungeons encapsulates the classic dungeon grind group experience into a single-player auto-combat RPG. Grind-friendly features such as auto use of skills, auto loot pick up and optional auto move, for people who love to theory craft, progress characters and grind without the burnout of long hours of very active gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/1769fe53e1ba7643ed81fc403d17b3d1.poster.avif?t=1761069744\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/1769fe53e1ba7643ed81fc403d17b3d1.webm?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/1769fe53e1ba7643ed81fc403d17b3d1.mp4?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a party of up to five characters, choosing any combination of the Warrior, Archer, and Mage classes and customize their builds to fit any role you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/8d1d3ec8110783bfc54dcc779136db0f.poster.avif?t=1761069744\" width=442 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/8d1d3ec8110783bfc54dcc779136db0f.webm?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/8d1d3ec8110783bfc54dcc779136db0f.mp4?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills include attacks, spells, buffs, auras and passives. Everything triggers automatically based on cooldowns and conditions, keeping the player's focus on build synergy and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/b9cc14c6c9efdba64bf961eaa648b6aa.poster.avif?t=1761069744\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/b9cc14c6c9efdba64bf961eaa648b6aa.webm?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/b9cc14c6c9efdba64bf961eaa648b6aa.mp4?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the combinator crafting system to merge and refine items toward your characters build BIS goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/6e89b5b798cbfbabcdd50e4900601f38.poster.avif?t=1761069744\" width=616 height=383 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/extras/6e89b5b798cbfbabcdd50e4900601f38.webm?t=1761069744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord community to participate in the Beta or discuss about the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A minimalist auto combat party RPG. Manage a party of adventurers set out to grind dungeons and get stronger!", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869250/0e01bd6293dbb838d362178b037fd0adf65e599c/header.jpg?t=1761069744", "capsule_i